Content type removal: fieldPath 'response.200[application/json]' → rest '200[application/json]' → regex `^[^\.\[]+?(?:\[[^\]]+\])?` — '200[application/json]': [^\.\[]+? lazily matches '200', then the optional [..] matches '[application/json]' → relative '' → null → operation-level: affects readers if 2xx.
