After that, create publishing-policy.js and publishing.service.js, the controller, and the routes.

Schema edit — add at the end:
```prisma
enum PublishOutcome {
  PUBLISHED
  BLOCKED
}

model PublishAttempt {
  id            String   @id @default(uuid())
  versionId     String
  // The AnalysisRun this decision was based on (null for attempts blocked
  // before a baseline/analysis check, e.g. invalid specifications or
  // initial versions without analysis requirements).
  analysisRunId String?
  outcome       PublishOutcome
  reason        String
  warnings      Json     @default("[]")
  // Machine-readable decision record (blocker codes, counts, affected
  // consumers, freshness results) so any past decision is explainable.
  decisionDetails Json   @default("{}")
  createdAt     DateTime @default(now())

  version     ApiVersion   @relation(fields: [versionId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  analysisRun AnalysisRun? @relation(fields: [analysisRunId], references: [id], onDelete: SetNull)

  @@index([versionId, createdAt])
  @@index([createdAt])
}
```
And add `publishAttempts PublishAttempt[]` to ApiVersion.

